        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Alexander Hall, Pierre Morel, Sidney Buchman, Seton I. Miller, Harry Segall, Antonio Negret, Michael Brandt, Derek Haas\n- Works: Here Comes Mr. Jordan, Heaven Can Wait, Overdrive\n- Roles: film director, theatre actor, cinematographer, producer, screenwriter\n\nFacts:\n- Alexander Hall was born on January 11, 1894, in Boston, Massachusetts.\n- Alexander Hall was an American film director and theatre actor.\n- Pierre Morel was born on May 12, 1964.\n- Pierre Morel is a French film director and cinematographer.\n- Here Comes Mr. Jordan was adapted by Sidney Buchman and Seton I. Miller from the play Heaven Can Wait.\n- Harry Segall wrote the play Heaven Can Wait.\n- Alexander Hall directed Here Comes Mr. Jordan.\n- Overdrive is a 2017 action thriller film directed by Antonio Negret.\n- Michael Brandt, Derek Haas, and Pierre Morel produced Overdrive.\n- Michael Brandt and Derek Haas wrote the screenplay for Overdrive.\n- Alexander Hall died on July 30, 1968, in San Francisco, California.",
